Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 20:39:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] nemesis: pharm-vocab transcript correction +
 Draft-flashcards-in-chat

- pharm-lexicon.ts: ~250-term canonical lexicon, edit-distance + consonant-
  skeleton fuzzy matcher (catches heavy vowel garbling like Lycinepral->
  lisinopril), pair-matching for split names (Brady Kinden->bradykinin) with
  small-word guards; zero false positives on plain English (smoke-tested).
- Recorder: corrections applied post-ASR with an 'n terms auto-corrected'
  badge; Draft flashcards button prefills a new chat with a strict TSV prompt
  (output pastes straight into Study Import).
